# Workflow: Fix Bug

## 1. Gather context
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.ai/project_profile.yaml`
- Capture exact reproduction steps
- Create a feature branch if on master

## 2. Reproduce the issue
- Identify the failing inputs and expected behavior
- Note relevant logs and errors

## 3. Isolate the root cause
- Trace the code path with search or logging
- Check recent commits for regressions

## 4. Lock in with a test
- Add a failing test following project patterns

## 5. Apply the fix
- Make the smallest change that resolves the issue
- Cover edge cases that caused the regression

## 6. Validate
- Re-run the original reproduction steps

## 7. Document and commit
- Update documentation if needed
- Commit with a clear summary of the fix
